      "expected_verdict_logic": "若 9 model (T_frac, R_frac) 落入横场 Ising 量子相变临界线 ±0.05 → BOSS 判 FAIL (P-C = 横场 Ising 特例); 否则 BOSS 判 PASS (P-C 超出横场 Ising 框架)",
